<title>USA: E.W. Scripps Jan consolidated revs rise.</title>
<headline>E.W. Scripps Jan consolidated revs rise.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>E.W. Scripps Co said Wednesday its consolidated revenues rose 9.3 percent in January, to $87.8 million from $80.4 million a year earlier.</p>
<p>The company said newspaper advertising revenues for the month were $39.1 million, up 12.3 percent, and total newspaper revenues rose 11.7 percent to $55.3 million.</p>
<p>In the entertainment division, revenues rose 14.6 percent to $10.5 million, it said.</p>
<p>Revenues from the television station group increased 1.6 percent to $22.1 million.</p>
